    "description": "## Proposed solution\n\nAdd a Checkbox field `Test__c` (label: Test) to Sign-Up. Not added to any page layout — set by admin or data load only.\n\n**Field Description:** \"Flags Sign-Ups created for testing or data import validation. Records with Test = True are excluded from operational reports and from Sign-Up count and attainment calculations. Set by admin or data load only — not exposed on page layouts.\"\n\n**Help Text:** n/a — not on page layouts.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n* Field exists on Sign-Up, defaults to False, and does not appear on any page layout.\n\nKobi, 2026-09-10.",
